00:33:28,398 --> 00:33:33,359
dawn. They came from almost every direction except from the west over the

416
00:33:33,359 --> 00:33:38,478
river, from the mountains. In that direction only one set of footprints led

417
00:33:38,478 --> 00:33:44,000
none coming, only ones going away from here. I followed these as far as the

418
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:48,639
car. There they disappeared into the river, but the water was too deep and

419
00:33:48,639 --> 00:33:51,279
strong beyond the rock for me to cross.

420
00:33:51,279 --> 00:33:55,279
It is easy enough, as you remember, to get from this bank to the Kok by the

