00:34:21,680 --> 00:34:26,478
before last. "And now I think I have answered your first question, too,"

428
00:34:26,478 --> 00:34:32,079
ended Gandalf, and he sat a long while silent. Bilbo thought he knew what the

429
00:34:32,079 --> 00:34:36,879
wizard meant. "What shall we do?" he cried. "If he leads all the wards and

430
00:34:36,879 --> 00:34:42,079
the goblins down here, we shall all be caught and killed. I thought you said he

431
00:34:42,079 --> 00:34:44,719
