00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:39,120
chief servants. So much they told him when he forced them. But he guessed

456
00:36:39,120 --> 00:36:43,680
there was more wickedness than this a foot, and that a great raid of the whole

457
00:36:43,680 --> 00:36:48,478
goblin army with their wolf alleys into the lands shadowed by the mountains

458
00:36:48,478 --> 00:36:53,359
might soon be made to find the dwarves, or to take vengeance on the men and

459
00:36:53,359 --> 00:36:58,639
creatures that lived there, and who they thought must be sheltering them. "It was

460
00:36:58,639 --> 00:37:03,279
a good story, that of yours," said Bejorn, "but I like it still better now.

461
00:37:03,279 --> 00:37:09,040
I am sure it is true. Ye must forgive my not taking your word. If you lived near

462
00:37:09,040 --> 00:37:13,520
the edge of Murkwood, you would take the word of no one that you did not know as

463
00:37:13,520 --> 00:37:18,159
well as your brother or better. As it is, I can only say that I have hurried

464
00:37:18,159 --> 00:37:22,799
home as fast as I could to see that you were safe, and to offer you any help

