00:38:40,318 --> 00:38:43,279
were streams and springs along the road.

483
00:38:43,279 --> 00:38:49,279
But your way through Murkwood is dark, dangerous, and difficult, he said. Water

484
00:38:49,279 --> 00:38:54,959
is not easy to find there, nor food. The time is not yet come for nuts, though it

485
00:38:54,959 --> 00:38:59,199
may be passed and gone indeed before you get to the other side, and nuts are

486
00:38:59,199 --> 00:39:02,000
about all that grows there fit for food.

487
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:07,600
In there the wild things are dark, queer, and savage. I will provide you

488
00:39:07,600 --> 00:39:12,559
with skins for carrying water, and I will give you some bows and arrows. But

489
00:39:12,559 --> 00:39:16,478
I doubt very much whether anything you find in Merkwood will be wholesome to

490
00:39:16,478 --> 00:39:21,760
eat or to drink. There is one stream there I know, black and strong, which

491
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:26,478
