602
00:48:09,279 --> 00:48:14,079
the food begins to run short. Then, at last they said goodbye to their ponies,

603
00:48:14,079 --> 00:48:19,040
and turned their heads for home. Off they trotted gay, seeming very glad to

604
00:48:19,040 --> 00:48:22,639
put their tails towards the shadow of Murkwood.

605
00:48:22,639 --> 00:48:26,719
As they went away, Bilbo could have sworn that a thing like a bear left the

606
00:48:26,719 --> 00:48:31,680
shadow of the trees, and shambled off quickly after them. Now, Gandalf too

607
00:48:31,680 --> 00:48:37,279
said farewell. Bilbo sat on the ground feeling very unhappy and wishing he was

608
00:48:37,279 --> 00:48:42,398
beside the wizard on his tall horse. He had gone just inside the forest after

609
00:48:42,398 --> 00:48:47,040
breakfast, a very poor one, and it had seemed as dark in there in the morning

610
00:48:47,040 --> 00:48:52,398
as at night, and very secret, a sort of watching and waiting feeling, he said to

611
00:48:52,398 --> 00:48:58,559
himself. "Goodbye," said Gandalf to Thoren. "And goodbye to you all.

612
00:48:58,559 --> 00:49:04,559
Goodbye. Straight through the forest is your way now. Don't stray off the track.

613
00:49:04,559 --> 00:49:09,520
If you do, it is a thousand to one. You will never find it again, and never get

614
00:49:09,520 --> 00:49:14,398
out of Mirkwood, and then I don't suppose I or anyone else will ever see

615
00:49:14,398 --> 00:49:19,840
you again. Do we really have to go through? Grown the Hobbit.

616
00:49:19,840 --> 00:49:25,199
Yes, you do, said the wizard. If you want to get to the other side, you must

617
00:49:25,199 --> 00:49:27,840
either go through or give up your quest.

618
00:49:27,840 --> 00:49:33,359
And I am not going to allow you to back out now, Mr. Baggins. I am ashamed of

619
00:49:33,359 --> 00:49:39,840
you for thinking of it. You have got to look after all these dwarves for me. He laughed.

620
00:49:39,840 --> 00:49:47,600
